{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>三星電子已成功開發出全球首款500層以上NAND閃存，單晶片容量較上一代提升50%，最快將於明年實現商用。</strong>三星計劃於明年2月在美國三藩市舉行的國際固態電路會議（ISSCC 2027）上公佈相關技術成果，該產品預計為三星第11代NAND閃存。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588252.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T16:44:29.471067+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T16:30:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T16:37:35.291844+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T16:37:35.291844+00:00","content_hash":"9015b0f19dd4041e7ffe2f2cacb5b91e550af23f91a84761ccc6009057c4ca6a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}